/target
# Workspace members (crates/*, examples/plugins/*) build into the root `target/`,
# but a standalone `cargo build` inside a member dir creates a nested `target/`.
# Ignore those build-artifact dirs everywhere (never commit build output).
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# NOTE: Cargo.lock IS committed (binary workspace + pinned gpui git deps for
# reproducibility — see _design/gpui_component_cookbook.md §3). Do not ignore it.
